  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "現代藝術的創意體驗",
    "sub_ename": "CREATIVE EXPERIENCE OF MODERN ART",
    "describe_ch": "《現代藝術的創意體驗》讓初次接觸藝術的同學透過簡單的小練習與深入淺出的理論介紹，來了解與體驗現代藝術的精神內涵。課程將啟發學生從不同的角度探索現代藝術中的四個主題，分別是超現實藝術、包浩斯美學、現代攝影、行為藝術。藉由觀察作品的形式、內容、與簡單地體驗創作和思考的過程，進而思考現代藝術家的創作意圖與所呈現的文化訊息。",
    "describe_eh": "\"Creative Experience of Modern Art\" allows students who are new to art to understand and experience the spiritual connotation of modern art through simple exercises and in-depth theoretical introductions. The course will inspire students to explore four themes in modern art from different perspectives, namely Surrealist art, Bauhaus aesthetics, modern photography, and performance art. By observing the form and content of the works, and experiencing the creative process, students can contemplate the creative intentions of modern artists and the cultural messages they present.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
